            <title>[IGNITE-10109] MVCC TX: data become inconsistent after several updates</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10109</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;see &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=4365543959682167276&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TC test history&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here we do concurrent updates on several accounts (update their balances incrementing one and decrementing another), we expect consistent sum of all accounts at any time.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sum become inconsistent after while.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
